 "words_heard": 226,
 "words": 231,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The word came to Jeremiah from the Lord",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "After Zedekiah made a covenant in the land",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To proclaim liberty for all the people found",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Set free your Hebrew slaves so none held down",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.56,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the officials and the people obeyed",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They set the male and female slaves at bay",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But afterward they changed their minds and turned",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Took back the freed and forced the laboring burned",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So now I proclaim liberty for you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Liberty to the sword plague and famine too",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will make you a horror to the earth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because you broke the covenant in your birth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I made a covenant with your fathers of old",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When I brought them out from the house of toil",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "At the end of seven years let them go free",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But they did not listen to what I said to be",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So now I proclaim liberty for you",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Liberty to the sword plague and famine too",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will make you a horror to the earth",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because you broke the covenant in your birth",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.79,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Like the calf they cut in two and walked through",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The priests and the leaders broke the law and broke the vow",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.83,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Their corpses will be food for birds in the sky",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And the beasts of the earth under the eye",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will bring them back to this city of stone",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To fight and to capture and to burn their home",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
 ],
